           \<and> Trans (seg N (Joints N ! (Lng (Br N) - 1)) (Lng N - 1))
               = Dpt (enat (entry N 1 (Joints N ! (Lng (Br N) - 1)))) tau)"
      by (rule vg6x_base_bridges_of_VE34[OF reg fin ve34 form])
  qed
qed

