(* ===== r39 assembly are the base facts (crx_base0_of_run /         ===== *)
(* ===== crx_base1_of_nest / crx_A0lt_of_nest), whose cIII enters    ===== *)
(* ===== solely through the FLAT c2 shape crx_c2_shape_condIII;      ===== *)
