    slots modulo {non-corner \<open>branchwit\<close>, descent pillar} via
    @{thm [source] dpr_two_slots_of_devchain}.

  \<^bold>\<open>Exact residual obstruction (what \<open>branchwit\<close> still needs).\<close>
